# Force LF for anything that runs as a Linux shell script or gets baked
# into a container build, regardless of a contributor's local git config.
# The repo is developed cross-platform but always deployed to Linux via
# Docker; a CRLF shebang line silently breaks `#!/bin/sh` at container
# startup.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
# PaddleOCR inference weights vendored under docker/ocr-models/.
*.pdiparams binary
